DG.put("ath-pakhyaan-charitr-likhyate/245",{"n":245,"title":null,"title_roman":null,"page":1975,"blocks":[{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚੌਪਈ","gurmukhi":"ਚੌਪਈ","roman":"Chaupaee","meaning_en":"Chaupai.","page":1975,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਚੌਪਈ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[1],"number_text":"੧।","page":1975,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਾਚੀ ਦਿਸਾ ਪ੍ਰਗਟ ਇਕ ਨਗਰੀ। ਖੰਭਾਵਤਿ ਸਭ ਜਗਤ ਉਜਗਰੀ।","roman":"Praachee disaa pragat ik nagree | khanbhaavti sabh jagat ujagree |","meaning_en":"In the east there is a well-known city, Khambhavati, famed through all the world.","page":1975,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪੂਰਬ ਦਿਸ਼ਾ ਵਿਚ ਇਕ ਨਗਰੀ ਖੰਭਾਵਤ ਨਾ ਦੀ ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ ਬਹੁਤ ਉਜਾਗਰ ਸੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਰੂਪ ਸੈਨ ਰਾਜਾ ਤਹ ਕੇਰਾ। ਜਾ ਕੈ ਦੁਸਟ ਨ ਬਾਚਾ ਨੇਰਾ। ੧।","roman":"Roop sain raajaa tah keraa | jaa kai dusat na baachaa neraa | 1 |","meaning_en":"Rup Sain was the king there; no enemy near him was left alive.","page":1975,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਸ ਦੇ ਰਾਜੇ ਦਾ ਨਾ ਰੂਪ ਸੈਨ ਸੀ ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਨੇੜੇ ਕੋਈ ਦੁਸ਼ਟ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਚਿਆ ਸੀ ॥੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2],"number_text":"੨।","page":1975,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਦਨ ਮੰਜਰੀ ਨਾਰਿ ਤਵਨ ਕੀ। ਸਸਿ ਕੀ ਸੀ ਛਬਿ ਲਗਤਿ ਜਵਨ ਕੀ।","roman":"Madan manjree naari tavan kee | sasi kee see chhabi lagti javan kee |","meaning_en":"Madan Manjari was his wife, whose beauty seemed like the moon's.","page":1975,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਸ ਦੀ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਦਾ ਨਾ ਮਦਨ ਮੰਜਰੀ ਸੀ। ਉਸ ਦੀ ਸੁੰਦਰਤਾ ਚੰਦ੍ਰਮਾ ਵਰਗੀ ਲਗਦੀ ਸੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਮ੍ਰਿਗ ਕੇ ਨੈਨ ਦੋਊ ਹਰਿ ਲੀਨੇ। ਸੁਕ ਨਾਸਾ ਕੋਕਿਲ ਬਚ ਦੀਨੇ। ੨।","roman":"Mrig ke nain do'oo hari leene | suk naasaa kokil bach deene | 2 |","meaning_en":"She had taken away both eyes of the deer; the parrot had given her its nose and the cuckoo its voice.","page":1975,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਸ ਨੇ ਹਿਰਨ ਦੇ ਦੋਵੇਾਂ ਨੈਣ ਚੁਰਾਏ ਹੋਏ ਸਨ। (ਉਸ ਨੂੰ) ਤੋਤੇ ਨੇ ਨੱਕ ਅਤੇ ਕੋਇਲ ਨੇ ਬੋਲ ਦਿੱਤੇ ਸਨ ॥੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3],"number_text":"੩।","page":1975,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਾਜਾ ਪਿਯਤ ਅਮਲ ਸਭ ਭਾਰੀ। ਭਾਤਿ ਭਾਤਿ ਸੌ ਭੋਗਤ ਨਾਰੀ।","roman":"Raajaa piyat amal sabh bhaaree | bhaati bhaati sau bhogat naaree |","meaning_en":"The king took all the strong intoxicants, and enjoyed women in many ways.","page":1975,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਰਾਜਾ ਬਹੁਤ ਅਧਿਕ ਅਮਲ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਕਈ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਰ ਨਾਲ ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਭੋਗਦਾ ਸੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪੋਸਤ ਭਾਗ ਅਫੀਮ ਚੜਾਵੈ। ਪ੍ਯਾਲੇ ਪੀ ਪਚਾਸਇਕ ਜਾਵੈ। ੩।","roman":"Posat bhaag apheem charaavai | pyaale pee pachaasaik jaavai | 3 |","meaning_en":"He took poppy-husk, bhang and opium, and would drink some fifty cups.","page":1975,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਭਾਗ: here bhang (cannabis), as throughout this charitra.","meaning_pa":"ਪੋਸਤ, ਭੰਗ ਅਤੇ ਅਫ਼ੀਮ ਖਾਦਾ ਸੀ ਅਤੇ (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਸ਼ਿਆਂ ਦੇ) ਪੰਜਾਹ ਕੁ ਪਿਆਲੇ ਪੀ ਜਾਦਾ ਸੀ ॥੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਅੜਿਲ","gurmukhi":"ਅੜਿਲ","roman":"Aril","meaning_en":"Arril.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੜਿਲ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[4],"number_text":"੪।","page":1977,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭਾਤਿ ਭਾਤਿ ਰਨਯਨਿ ਸੌ ਭੋਗ ਕਮਾਵਈ।","roman":"Bhaati bhaati ranayni sau bhog kamaavaee |","meaning_en":"He made love with his queens in many ways;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ) ਰਾਣੀਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਭਾਤ ਭਾਤ ਦੇ ਭੋਗ ਕਰਦਾ ਸੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਸਨ ਚੁੰਬਨ ਕਰਤ ਨ ਗਨਨਾ ਆਵਈ।","roman":"Aasan chunban karat na gannaa aavaee |","meaning_en":"the postures and kisses he made were beyond counting.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਆਸਣ ਅਤੇ ਚੁੰਬਨ (ਇਤਨੇ) ਲੈਂਦਾ ਸੀ ਕਿ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਵਿਚ ਨਹੀਂ ਆਉਾਂਦੇ ਸਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਚਾਰਿ ਪਹਰ ਰਤਿ ਕਰੈ ਅਧਿਕ ਸੁਖ ਪਾਇ ਕੈ।","roman":"Chaari pahar rati karai adhik sukh paai kai |","meaning_en":"He would make love through four watches, gaining great pleasure;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਚਾਰ ਪਹਿਰ (ਰਾਤ) ਸੁਖ ਪੂਰਵਕ ਰਤੀ-ਕ੍ਰੀੜਾ ਕਰਦਾ ਸੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਜੋ ਰਾਨੀ ਤਿਹ ਰਮੇ ਰਹੈ ਉਰਝਾਇ ਕੈ। ੪।","roman":"Ho jo raanee tih rame rahai urjhaai kai | 4 |","meaning_en":"whichever queen lay with him remained captivated.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5],"number_text":"੫।","page":1977,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸ੍ਰੀ ਰਸ ਤਿਲਕ ਮੰਜਰੀ ਤ੍ਰਿਯਿਕ ਬਖਾਨਿਯੈ।","roman":"Sree ras tilak manjree triyik bakhaaniyai |","meaning_en":"There was a woman called Sri Ras Tilak Manjari,","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ ਰਾਣੀ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਨਾਲ ਰਮਣ ਕਰਦੀ, (ਉਹੀ) ਉਲਝ ਕੇ (ਭਾਵ ਮੋਹਿਤ ਹੋ ਕੇ) ਰਹਿ ਜਾਦੀ ॥੪॥ ਰਸ ਤਿਲਕ ਮੰਜਰੀ ਨਾ ਦੀ ਇਕ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਦਸੀ ਜਾਦੀ ਸੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਧਿਕ ਜਗਤ ਕੇ ਮਾਝ ਧਨਵਤੀ ਜਾਨਿਯੈ।","roman":"Adhik jagat ke maajh dhanavtee jaaniyai |","meaning_en":"known in the world as very wealthy.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਜਾਵਿਤ੍ਰੀ ਜਾਇਫਰ ਨ ਸਾਹੁ ਚਬਾਵਈ।","roman":"Jaavitree jaaiphar na saahu chabaavaee |","meaning_en":"Her husband the merchant chewed neither mace nor nutmeg;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'Her husband' is supplied; the line has only ਸਾਹੁ, 'the merchant'.","meaning_pa":"(ਉਸ ਨੂੰ) ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ ਬਹੁਤ ਧਨਵਾਨ ਸਮਝਿਆ ਜਾਦਾ ਸੀ। (ਉਹ) ਸ਼ਾਹ ਜਲਵਤ੍ਰੀ ਅਤੇ ਜਾਫਲ ਆਦਿ ਕੁਝ ਵੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਸੀ ਚਬਾਦਾ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਸੋਫੀ ਸੂਮ ਨ ਭੂਲਿ ਭਾਗ ਕੌ ਖਾਵਈ। ੫।","roman":"Ho sophee soom na bhooli bhaag kau khaavaee | 5 |","meaning_en":"an abstainer and a miser, he never ate bhang even by mistake.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸੋਫੀ: one who abstains from intoxicants (a sober man), rendered 'abstainer' throughout.","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਸੋਫੀ ਤੇ ਸ਼ੂਮ ਹੋਣ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਭੁਲ ਕੇ ਵੀ ਭੰਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਖਾਦਾ ਸੀ ॥੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6],"number_text":"੬।","page":1977,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਾਹੁ ਆਪੁ ਕੌ ਸ੍ਯਾਨੋ ਅਧਿਕ ਕਹਾਵਈ।","roman":"Saahu aapu kau syaano adhik kahaavaee |","meaning_en":"The merchant called himself very wise;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ਾਹ ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਨੂੰ ਬਹੁਤ ਸਿਆਣਾ ਅਖਵਾਦਾ ਸੀ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਭੂਲ ਭਾਗ ਸੁਪਨੇ ਹੂੰ ਨ ਘੋਟਿ ਚੜਾਵਈ।","roman":"Bhool bhaag supne hoon na ghoti charaavaee |","meaning_en":"not even in a dream would he grind bhang and take it.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਸੁਪਨੇ ਵਿਚ ਭੁਲ ਕੇ ਵੀ ਭੰਗ ਘੋਟ ਕੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਪੀਂਦਾ ਸੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਿਯੈ ਜੁ ਰਾਨੀ ਭਾਗ ਅਧਿਕ ਤਾ ਸੌ ਲਰੈ।","roman":"Piyai ju raanee bhaag adhik taa sau larai |","meaning_en":"If his lady drank bhang he quarrelled greatly with her;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਾਨੀ: literally 'queen'; taken here as the merchant's own wife; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ ਰਾਣੀ ਭੰਗ ਪੀਂਦੀ ਸੀ, ਉਸ ਨਾਲ ਬਹੁਤ ਲੜਦਾ ਸੀ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਕੌਡੀ ਕਰ ਤੇ ਦਾਨ ਨ ਸੋਕਾਤੁਰ ਕਰੈ। ੬।","roman":"Ho kaudee kar te daan na sokaatur karai | 6 |","meaning_en":"and, sick with worry, he would not give even a cowrie in charity from his hand.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸੋਕਾਤੁਰ: 'distressed with grief'; taken as describing the miser.","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਕਿਸੇ ਦੀਨ-ਦੁਖੀਏ ਨੂੰ ਇਕ ਕੌਡੀ ਵੀ ਹੱਥੋਂ ਦਾਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਸੀ ॥੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚੌਪਈ","gurmukhi":"ਚੌਪਈ","roman":"Chaupaee","meaning_en":"Chaupai.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਚੌਪਈ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[7],"number_text":"੭।","page":1977,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਿਯਤ ਭਾਗ ਕਾਹੂ ਜੋ ਹੇਰੈ। ਠਾਢੇ ਹੋਤ ਨ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਨੇਰੈ।","roman":"Piyat bhaag kaahoo jo herai | thaadhe hot na taa ke nerai |","meaning_en":"If he saw anyone drinking bhang, he would not stand near him.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ) ਜੇ ਕਿਸੇ ਨੂੰ ਭੰਗ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਵੇਖਦਾ, (ਤਾ) ਉਸ ਦੇ ਨੇੜੇ ਨਾ ਖੜੋਂਦਾ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਭਯੋ ਸਦਨ ਤਿਹ ਕਹੈ ਉਜਾਰਾ। ਜਾ ਕੈ ਕੂੰਡਾ ਬਜੈ ਦੁਆਰਾ। ੭।","roman":"Bhayo sadan tih kahai ujaaraa | jaa kai koondaa bajai duaaraa | 7 |","meaning_en":"He would say, \"That house is ruined at whose door the grinding-bowl sounds.\"","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕੂੰਡਾ: the stone bowl in which bhang is ground.","meaning_pa":"ਕਹਿੰਦਾ ਸੀ ਕਿ ਉਸ ਘਰ ਦਾ ਉਜਾੜਾ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ ਜਿਸ ਘਰ ਵਿਚ (ਭੰਗ ਘੋਟਣ ਲਈ) ਕੂੰਡਾ ਸੋਟਾ ਖੜਕਦਾ ਹੈ ॥੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8],"number_text":"੮।","page":1977,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤਾ ਕੋ ਹੋਤ ਉਜਾਰ ਕਹੈ ਘਰ। ਭਾਂਗ ਅਫੀਮ ਭਖਤ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਨਰ।","roman":"Taa ko hot ujaar kahai ghar | bhaang apheem bhakhat hai jo nar |","meaning_en":"He would say, \"Ruined is the house of the man who eats bhang and opium.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਕਹਿੰਦਾ ਕਿ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਘਰ ਉਜਾੜ ਹੋ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ ਜੋ ਬੰਦਾ ਭੰਗ ਅਤੇ ਅਫ਼ੀਮ ਖਾਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੋਫੀ ਸਕਲ ਬੁਧਿ ਬਲ ਰਹੈ। ਅਮਲਿਨ ਕੋ ਕਛੂ ਕੈ ਨਹਿ ਕਹੈ। ੮।","roman":"Sophee sakal budhi bal rahai | amlin ko kachhoo kai nahi kahai | 8 |","meaning_en":"The abstainer keeps all his wits and strength.\" He counted the users of intoxicants as nothing.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Second half: 'ਅਮਲਿਨ ਕੋ ਕਛੂ ਕੈ ਨਹਿ ਕਹੈ', taken as 'he did not reckon users as anything'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਸਾਰੇ ਸੋਫ਼ੀ ਬੁੱਧੀ ਦੇ ਬਲ ਤੇ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਅਮਲੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਉਹ ਕੁਝ ਵੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਗਿਣਦੇ ॥੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9],"number_text":"੯।","page":1977,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਯਹ ਰਸ ਤਿਲਕ ਮੰਜਰੀ ਸੁਨੀ। ਗਈ ਪਾਸ ਹਸਿ ਮੂੰਡੀ ਧੁਨੀ।","roman":"Yah ras tilak manjree sunee | gaee paas hasi moondee dhunee |","meaning_en":"Ras Tilak Manjari heard this; she went to him laughing and shaking her head.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜਦ ਤਿਲਕ ਮੰਜਰੀ ਨੇ (ਇਹ ਸਭ ਕੁਝ) ਸੁਣਿਆ (ਤਾ ਉਹ) ਹਸਦੀ ਅਤੇ ਸਿਰ ਹਿਲਾਦੀ ਹੋਈ (ਉਸ ਕੋਲ) ਗਈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਹਾ ਬਕਤ ਹੈ ਪਰਿਯੋ ਮੰਦ ਮਤਿ। ਬਾਹਨ ਸੋਫਿ ਸੀਤਲਾ ਕੀ ਗਤਿ। ੯।","roman":"Kahaa bakat hai pariyo mand mati | baahan sophi seetlaa kee gati | 9 |","meaning_en":"\"What are you babbling as you lie there, dull-witted one? The abstainer's state is that of Sitala's mount.\"","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Sitala's mount is the donkey; she is calling the abstainer an ass.","meaning_pa":"(ਕਹਿਣ ਲਗੀ) ਹੇ ਮੰਦ ਬੁੱਧੀ ਵਾਲੇ! ਕੀ ਬਕ ਬਕ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ ਹੈਂ, ਸੋਫ਼ੀ ਦੀ ਸਥਿਤੀ ਤਾ ਸੀਤਲਾ ਦੇ ਬਾਹਨ (ਅਰਥਾਤ ਖੋਤੇ) ਵਰਗੀ ਹੁੰਦੀ ਹੈ ॥੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਛੰਦ","roman":"Chhand","meaning_en":"Chhand.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਛੰਦ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[10],"number_text":"੧੦।","page":1977,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਪਿਯਹਿ ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਰਾਜ ਅਧਿਕ ਇਸਤ੍ਰੀਯਨ ਬਿਹਾਰੈ।","roman":"Amal piyhi nrip raaj adhik istreeyan bihaarai |","meaning_en":"Kings take intoxicants and sport much with women;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਰਾਜਾ ਅਮਲ ਪੀਂਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਅਧਿਕ ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਵਿਹਾਰ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਸੂਰਮਾ ਪਿਯਹਿ ਦੁਜਨ ਸਿਰ ਖੜਗ ਪ੍ਰਹਾਰੈ।","roman":"Amal soormaa piyhi dujan sir kharag prahaarai |","meaning_en":"warriors take intoxicants and strike the sword on the enemy's head;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸੂਰਮਾ ਅਮਲ ਪੀਂਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਦੁਸ਼ਟਾ ਦੇ ਸਿਰ ਉਤੇ ਖੜਗ ਦਾ ਵਾਰ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਭਖਹਿ ਜੋਗੀਸ ਧ੍ਯਾਨ ਜਦੁਪਤਿ ਕੋ ਧਰਹੀ।","roman":"Amal bhakhhi jogees dhyaan jadupti ko dharhee |","meaning_en":"great yogis eat intoxicants and fix their meditation on the Lord of the Yadus;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਦੁਪਤਿ: Krishna.","meaning_pa":"ਜੋਗੀ ਅਮਲ ਖਾਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਭਗਵਾਨ ਨਾਲ ਆਪਣਾ ਧਿਆਨ ਜੋੜਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਚਾਖਿ ਤਵਨ ਕੋ ਸ੍ਵਾਦ ਸੂਮ ਸੋਫੀ ਕ੍ਯਾ ਕਰਹੀ। ੧੦।","roman":"Chaakhi tavan ko svaad soom sophee kyaa karhee | 10 |","meaning_en":"what would a miserly abstainer do, even tasting their savour?","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"May also be read 'what does the miserly abstainer know of their taste'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ (ਨਸ਼ਿਆਂ) ਦਾ ਸੁਆਦ ਚਖ ਕੇ ਭਲਾ ਸ਼ੂਮ ਸੋਫ਼ੀ ਕੀ ਕਰਨਗੇ ॥੧੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"speaker","name":"ਸਾਹੁ ਬਾਚ","gurmukhi":"ਸਾਹੁ ਬਾਚ","roman":"Saahu baach","meaning_en":"The merchant said:","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ਾਹ ਨੇ ਕਿਹਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[11],"number_text":"੧੧।","page":1977,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਪਿਯਤ ਜੇ ਪੁਰਖ ਪਰੇ ਦਿਨ ਰੈਨਿ ਉਘਾਵਤ।","roman":"Amal piyat je purakh pare din raini ughaavat |","meaning_en":"Men who take intoxicants lie dozing day and night;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਅਮਲ ਪੀਂਦਾ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਦਿਨ ਰਾਤ ਊਾਂਘਦਾ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਜੁ ਘਰੀ ਨ ਪਿਯਹਿ ਤਾਪ ਤਿਨ ਕਹ ਚੜਿ ਆਵਤ।","roman":"Amal ju gharee na piyhi taap tin kah chari aavat |","meaning_en":"if they miss the intoxicant for an hour, a fever comes upon them.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜੇ ਘੜੀ ਭਰ ਅਮਲ ਨਾ ਪੀਵੇ ਤਾ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ ਤਾਪ ਚੜ੍ਰਹ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਪੁਰਖੁ ਜੋ ਪੀਯੈ ਕਿਸੁ ਕਾਰਜ ਕੇ ਨਾਹੀ।","roman":"Amal purkhu jo peeyai kisu kaaraj ke naahee |","meaning_en":"The man who takes intoxicants is fit for no work;","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਅਮਲ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਨ, ਉਹ ਕਿਸੇ ਕੰਮ ਦੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਖਾਇ ਗੜ ਰਹੈ ਮ੍ਰਿਤਕ ਹ੍ਵੈ ਕੈ ਘਰ ਮਾਹੀ। ੧੧।","roman":"Amal khaai gar rahai mritak hvai kai ghar maahee | 11 |","meaning_en":"having eaten the intoxicant he lies sunk in the house like a corpse.","page":1977,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"speaker","name":"ਤ੍ਰਿਯੋ ਬਾਚ","gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਯੋ ਬਾਚ","roman":"Triyo baach","meaning_en":"The woman said:","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[12],"number_text":"੧੨।","page":1979,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸ੍ਯਾਨੇ ਸੋਚਿਤ ਰਹੈ ਰਾਜ ਕੈਫਿਯੈ ਕਮਾਵੈ।","roman":"Syaane sochit rahai raaj kaiphiyai kamaavai |","meaning_en":"The clever stay lost in worry, while the drinkers enjoy kingship;","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਮਲ ਖਾ ਕੇ ਘਰ ਵਿਚ ਮੁਰਦੇ ਵਾਗ ਪਏ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੧੧॥ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਕਿਹਾ: ਸਿਆਣੇ ਸੋਚਦੇ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਅਮਲੀ ਰਾਜ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 3 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੂਮ ਸੰਚਿ ਧਨ ਰਹੇ ਸੂਰ ਦਿਨ ਏਕ ਲੁਟਾਵੈ।","roman":"Soom sanchi dhan rahe soor din ek lutaavai |","meaning_en":"misers go on hoarding wealth, while the brave give it all away in a day.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ੂਮ ਧਨ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਕਰਦਾ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਸੂਰਮਾ ਇਕ ਦਿਨ ਵਿਚ ਲੁਟਾ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਪੀਏ ਜਸੁ ਹੋਇ ਦਾਨ ਖਾਂਡੇ ਨਹਿ ਹੀਨੋ।","roman":"Amal pee'e jasu hoi daan khaande nahi heeno |","meaning_en":"By taking intoxicants comes fame; such men are not wanting in giving or in the sword.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਤ ਗੁਦਾ ਕੇ ਪੈਡ ਸੂਮ ਸੋਫੀ ਜਿਯ ਦੀਨੋ। ੧੨।","roman":"Ant gudaa ke paid soom sophee jiy deeno | 12 |","meaning_en":"In the end the miserly abstainer gives up his life by way of the anus.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Literal; a taunt that the miser dies an ignoble death.","meaning_pa":"ਅਮਲ ਪੀਣ ਨਾਲ ਜਸ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਦਾਨ ਦੇਣ ਅਤੇ ਖੰਡਾ ਖੜਕਾਉਣ ਵਿਚ ਹੀਣਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੋਣਾ ਪੈਂਦਾ। ਸ਼ੂਮ ਸੋਫ਼ੀ ਆਪਣੇ ਪ੍ਰਾਣ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ ਗੁੱਦਾ ਦੇ ਰਸਤੇ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ ॥੧੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[13],"number_text":"੧੩।","page":1979,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭਾਂਗ ਪੁਰਖ ਵੈ ਪਿਯਹਿ ਭਗਤ ਹਰਿ ਕੀ ਜੇ ਕਰਹੀ।","roman":"Bhaang purakh vai piyhi bhagat hari kee je karhee |","meaning_en":"Those men drink bhang who practise devotion to Hari;","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਭੰਗ ਉਹ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਨ ਜੋ ਹਰਿ ਭਗਤੀ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਭਾਂਗ ਭਖਤ ਵੈ ਪੁਰਖ ਕਿਸੂ ਕੀ ਆਸ ਨ ਧਰਹੀ।","roman":"Bhaang bhakhat vai purakh kisoo kee aas na dharhee |","meaning_en":"those men eat bhang who place their hope in no one;","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਪਿਯਤ ਤੇ ਬੀਰ ਬਰਤ ਜਿਨ ਤ੍ਰਿਨ ਮਸਤਕ ਪਰ।","roman":"Amal piyat te beer barat jin trin mastak par |","meaning_en":"those heroes take intoxicants who hold their own heads as cheap as straw;","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'ਬਰਤ ਜਿਨ ਤ੍ਰਿਨ ਮਸਤਕ ਪਰ': literally 'on whose foreheads straw burns'; sense uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਭੰਗ ਉਹ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਨ, ਜੋ ਕਿਸੇ ਦੀ ਆਸ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦੇ। ਅਮਲ ਉਹ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਨ ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਮੱਥੇ ਉਤੇ ਤਿਨਕੇ ਸੜ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ (ਭਾਵ ਬਹੁਤ ਤੇਜਸਵੀ ਮਸਤਕ ਵਾਲੇ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ।)","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਤੇ ਕ੍ਯਾ ਪੀਵਹਿ ਭਾਂਗ ਰਹੈ ਜਿਨ ਕੇ ਤਕਰੀ ਕਰ। ੧੩।","roman":"Te kyaa peevhi bhaang rahai jin ke takree kar | 13 |","meaning_en":"what bhang would they drink, in whose hands the scales always stay?","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਲੋਕ ਕੀ ਭੰਗ ਪੀਣਗੇ ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਹੱਥ ਵਿਚ ਤਕੜੀ ਰਹਿੰਦੀ ਹੈ ॥੧੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਅੜਿਲ","gurmukhi":"ਅੜਿਲ","roman":"Aril","meaning_en":"Arril.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੜਿਲ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[14],"number_text":"੧੪।","page":1979,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦਾ ਸਰੋਹੀ ਊਪਰ ਕਰ ਜਿਨ ਕੋ ਰਹੈ।","roman":"Sadaa sarohee oopar kar jin ko rahai |","meaning_en":"Those whose hand is ever upon the sword,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਭੰਗ ਉਹ ਲੋਕ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਨ) ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਹੱਥ ਸਦਾ ਤਲਵਾਰ ਉਤੇ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਿਰ ਮੋ ਖਾਇ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਨ ਜੁ ਤਿਹ ਕਟੁ ਬਚ ਕਹੈ।","roman":"Sir mo khaai kripaan ju tih katu bach kahai |","meaning_en":"at whose hands whoever speaks a harsh word takes the sword on his head,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Taken as: the one who speaks harshly to them is struck; could be 'who take a sword-blow on the head sooner than hear a harsh word'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ ਕੌੜੇ ਬਚਨ ਕਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਸਿਰ ਉਤੇ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਨ ਦਾ ਵਾਰ ਸਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿੰਬੂਆ ਟਿਕ ਕਹਿ ਰਹੈ ਮੂੰਛਿ ਐਸੇ ਕੀਏ।","roman":"Ninbooaa tik kahi rahai moonchhi aise kee'e |","meaning_en":"whose moustaches are so set that a lemon would rest on them,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਮੁੱਛਾ ਨੂੰ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ (ਵਟ ਚੜ੍ਰਹਾਈ) ਰਖਦੇ ਹਨ ਕਿ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਉਤੇ ਨਿੰਬੂ ਟਿਕੇ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਤੇ ਨਰ ਪੀਵਹਿ ਭਾਂਗ ਕਹਾ ਪਸੁ ਤੈ ਪੀਏ। ੧੪।","roman":"Ho te nar peevhi bhaang kahaa pasu tai pee'e | 14 |","meaning_en":"those men drink bhang; what, beast, would you drink?","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[15],"number_text":"੧੫।","page":1979,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਗੰਜਾਨ ਜੋ ਗੰਜਤ ਸਦਾ ਅਗੰਜ ਨਰ।","roman":"Aganjaan jo ganjat sadaa aganj nar |","meaning_en":"The unconquerable men who ever conquer the unconquerable,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਹੀ ਭੰਗ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਨ, ਤੇਰੇ ਵਰਗੇ ਪਸ਼ੂ ਕਿਥੇ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੧੪॥ ਨ ਗੰਜੇ ਜਾਣ ਵਾਲਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਗੰਜਿਤ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਸਦਾ ਅਗੰਜ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਸਤ ਤਾਪ ਤੁਟਿ ਜਾਇ ਨਿਰਖਿ ਜਿਹ ਖੜਗ ਕਰ।","roman":"Trasat taap tuti jaai nirkhi jih kharag kar |","meaning_en":"at the sight of the sword in whose hand the foe trembles and his heat is broken,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'ਤ੍ਰਸਤ ਤਾਪ ਤੁਟਿ ਜਾਇ': 'fear and fever break'; exact sense uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਹੱਥ ਵਿਚ ਤਲਵਾਰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਡਰੇ ਹੋਇਆਂ ਦਾ ਦੁਖ ਦੂਰ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਤੇ ਪੀਵਤ ਹੈ ਭਾਂਗ ਅਧਿਕ ਜਿਨ ਜਸ ਲਏ।","roman":"Te peevat hai bhaang adhik jin jas lae |","meaning_en":"they drink bhang, who have won great fame,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਭੰਗ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਨ ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੇ (ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ) ਅਧਿਕ ਜਸ ਲੈਣਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਦਾਨ ਖਾਂਡ ਕੈ ਪ੍ਰਥਮ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਜਗ ਤੇ ਗਏ। ੧੫।","roman":"Ho daan khaand kai pratham bahuri jag te gae | 15 |","meaning_en":"who first gave in charity and wielded the sword, and then went from the world.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ ਤਲਵਾਰ-ਦਾਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ, ਫਿਰ ਸੰਸਾਰ ਤੋਂ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੧੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","gurmukhi":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","roman":"Dohraa","meaning_en":"Dohra.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦੋਹਰਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[16],"number_text":"੧੬।","page":1979,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤੇ ਨਰ ਕੈਫਨ ਕੋ ਪਿਯਤ ਤੈ ਕ੍ਯਾ ਪਿਯਹਿ ਅਜਾਨ।","roman":"Te nar kaiphan ko piyat tai kyaa piyhi ajaan |","meaning_en":"Such men drink intoxicants; what would you drink, ignorant one,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਹੀ ਨਸ਼ੇ ਦਾ ਸੇਵਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ, ਹੇ ਅਜਾਨ! ਤੂੰ ਕੀ ਨਸ਼ਾ ਕਰੇਾਂਗਾ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਰ ਤਕਰੀ ਪਕਰਤ ਰਹਿਯੋ ਕਸੀ ਨ ਕਮਰ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਨ। ੧੬।","roman":"Kar takree pakrat rahiyo kasee na kamar kripaan | 16 |","meaning_en":"who went on holding the scales in your hand and never girded a sword at your waist?","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸਦਾ ਹੱਥ ਵਿਚ ਤਕੜੀ ਹੀ ਫੜੀ ਹੈ, (ਕਦੇ) ਲਕ ਨਾਲ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਸੀ ॥੧੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚੌਪਈ","gurmukhi":"ਚੌਪਈ","roman":"Chaupaee","meaning_en":"Chaupai.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਚੌਪਈ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[17],"number_text":"੧੭।","page":1979,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਯੌ ਸੁਨਿ ਬੈਨ ਸਾਹੁ ਰਿਸਿ ਭਰਿਯੋ। ਨਿਜੁ ਤ੍ਰਿਯ ਕਹ ਕਟੁ ਬਚਨ ਉਚਰਿਯੋ।","roman":"Yau suni bain saahu risi bhariyo | niju triy kah katu bachan uchriyo |","meaning_en":"Hearing these words the merchant filled with rage, and spoke harsh words to his wife.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਬੋਲ ਸੁਣ ਕੇ ਸ਼ਾਹ ਗੁੱਸੇ ਨਾਲ ਭਰ ਗਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਆਪਣੀ ਪਤਨੀ ਨੂੰ ਕੌੜੇ ਬੋਲ ਬੋਲੇ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਲਾਤ ਮੁਸਟ ਭੇ ਕੀਏ ਪ੍ਰਹਾਰਾ। ਤੈ ਕ੍ਯੋ ਐਸੀ ਭਾਤਿ ੳਚਾਰਾ। ੧੭।","roman":"Laat musat bhe kee'e prahaaraa | tai kyo aisee bhaati uchaaraa | 17 |","meaning_en":"He struck her with kicks and fists: \"Why did you speak in this way?\"","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ੳਚਾਰਾ: printed so; read as ਉਚਾਰਾ.","meaning_pa":"(ਉਸ ਉਤੇ) ਲੱਤਾ ਅਤੇ ਮੁਕਿਆਂ ਦਾ ਪ੍ਰਹਾਰ ਕੀਤਾ (ਅਤੇ ਕਿਹਾ ਕਿ) ਤੂੰ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਕਿਉਾਂ ਬੋਲੀ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"speaker","name":"ਤ੍ਰਿਯੋ ਬਾਚ","gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਯੋ ਬਾਚ","roman":"Triyo baach","meaning_en":"The woman said:","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਕਿਹਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[18],"number_text":"੧੮।","page":1979,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਹੋ ਸਾਹੁ ਤੌ ਸਾਚ ਉਚਰਊ। ਤੁਮ ਤੇ ਤਊ ਅਧਿਕ ਜਿਯ ਡਰਊ।","roman":"Kaho saahu tau saach uchraoo | tum te taoo adhik jiy daraoo |","meaning_en":"\"If you say so, merchant, I will speak the truth, though I am greatly afraid of you in my heart.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਹੇ ਸ਼ਾਹ ਜੀ! ਜੇ ਕਹੋ ਤਾ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਸੱਚ ਆਖਾ। ਫਿਰ ਵੀ (ਮੈਂ) ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਪਾਸੋਂ ਬਹੁਤ ਡਰਦੀ ਹਾ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਜੋ ਕੁਲ ਰੀਤਿ ਬਡਨ ਚਲਿ ਆਈ। ਸੋ ਮੈ ਤੁਹਿ ਪ੍ਰਤਿ ਕਹਤ ਸੁਨਾਈ। ੧੮।","roman":"Jo kul reeti badan chali aaee | so mai tuhi prati kahat sunaaee | 18 |","meaning_en":"The custom of the family that has come down from the elders, that I tell you.\"","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ ਵੱਡਿਆਂ ਦੀ ਕੁਲ-ਰੀਤ ਚਲੀ ਆਈ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਮੈਂ ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਪ੍ਰਤਿ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਸੁਣਾਉਾਂਦੀ ਹਾ ॥੧੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਛਪੈ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਛਪੈ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Chhapai chhand","meaning_en":"Chhapai metre.","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਛਪੈ ਛੰਦ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[19],"number_text":"੧੯।","page":1979,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦਿਜਨ ਦਾਨ ਦੀਬੋ ਦ੍ਰੁਜਾਨ ਸਿਰ ਖੜਗ ਬਜੈਬੋ।","roman":"Dijan daan deebo drujaan sir kharag bajaibo |","meaning_en":"To give gifts to Brahmins, to strike the sword on the heads of the wicked,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਬ੍ਰਾਹਮਣਾ ਨੂੰ ਦਾਨ ਦੇਣਾ, ਦੁਰਜਨਾ ਦੇ ਸਿਰ ਤੇ ਖੜਕ ਵਜਾਣਾ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਮਹਾ ਦੁਸਟ ਕਹ ਦੰਡਿ ਦਾਰਿਦ ਦੀਨਾਨ ਗਵੈਬੋ।","roman":"Mahaa dusat kah dandi daarid deenaan gavaibo |","meaning_en":"to punish the great tyrant, to remove the poverty of the poor,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਹਾ ਦੁਸ਼ਟਾ ਨੂੰ ਦੰਡਿ ਦੇਣਾ, ਗ਼ਰੀਬਾ ਨਿਤਾਣਿਆਂ ਦਾ ਦਰਿਦ੍ਰ ਦੂਰ ਕਰਨਾ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਜੁ ਨਾਰਿਨ ਕੇ ਸਾਥ ਕੇਲ ਚਿਰ ਲੌ ਮਚਿ ਮੰਡਬ।","roman":"Niju naarin ke saath kel chir lau machi mandab |","meaning_en":"to sport long in love with one's own wives,","page":1979,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਆਪਣੀਆਂ ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਕੇਲ-ਕ੍ਰੀੜਾ ਚਿਰ ਤਕ ਕਾਇਮ ਕਰਨਾ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਖੰਡ ਖੰਡ ਰਨ ਖੇਤ ਖਲਨ ਖੰਡਨ ਸੌ ਖੰਡਬ।","roman":"Khand khand ran khet khalan khandan sau khandab |","meaning_en":"to cut the wicked to pieces with the sword on the field of battle:","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਰਣ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ ਵੈਰੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਖੰਡੇ ਨਾਲ ਟੋਟੇ ਟੋਟੇ ਕਰਨਾ (ਆਦਿ ਕੁਸ਼ਲ ਕਰਮ ਹਨ)।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਨ ਪੀ ਏਤੀ ਕਰੈ ਕ੍ਯੋ ਆਯੋ ਮਹਿ ਲੋਕ ਮਹਿ।","roman":"Amal na pee etee karai kyo aayo mahi lok mahi |","meaning_en":"he who does not take intoxicants and do all this, why did he come into the world of men?","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਮਲ ਪੀ ਕੇ ਜੋ ਇਹ ਕੁਝ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦੇ, (ਉਹ) ਇਸ ਲੋਕ ਵਿਚ ਕਿਉਾਂ ਆਏ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਰ ਅਸੁਰ ਜਛ ਗੰਧ੍ਰਬ ਸਭੈ ਤਿਹ ਨਰ ਕੌ ਹਸਿ ਹਸਿ ਕਹਹਿ। ੧੯।","roman":"Sur asur jachh gandhrab sabhai tih nar kau hasi hasi kahhi | 19 |","meaning_en":"Gods, demons, yakshas and gandharvas all say this of that man, laughing.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਗੱਲ ਉਸ ਆਦਮੀ ਨੂੰ ਦੇਵਤੇ, ਦੈਂਤ, ਯਕਸ਼, ਗੰਧਰਬ ਹੱਸ ਹੱਸ ਕੇ ਕਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੧੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਛੰਦ","roman":"Chhand","meaning_en":"Chhand.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਛੰਦ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[20],"number_text":"੨੦।","page":1981,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸੋ ਨਰ ਪਿਯਤ ਨ ਭਾਂਗ ਰਹੈ ਕੌਡੀ ਮਹਿ ਜਿਹ ਚਿਤ।","roman":"So nar piyat na bhaang rahai kaudee mahi jih chit |","meaning_en":"That man does not drink bhang whose mind stays on the cowrie;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੋ ਨਰ ਅਮਲ ਨ ਪਿਯੈ ਦਾਨ ਭੇ ਨਹਿ ਜਾ ਕੋ ਹਿਤ।","roman":"So nar amal na piyai daan bhe nahi jaa ko hit |","meaning_en":"that man does not take intoxicants who has no love of giving;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ ਬੰਦਾ ਭੰਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਪੀਂਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਜਿਸ ਦਾ ਮਨ ਕੌਡੀ (ਮਾਇਆ) ਵਿਚ ਲਗਾ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਜੋ ਵਿਅਕਤੀ ਅਮਲ ਨਹੀਂ ਪੀਂਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਜਿਸ ਦਾ ਦਾਨ ਦੇਣ ਵਿਚ ਹਿਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸ੍ਯਾਨੋ ਅਧਿਕ ਕਹਾਇ ਕਾਕ ਕੀ ਉਪਮਾ ਪਾਵਹਿ।","roman":"Syaano adhik kahaai kaak kee upmaa paavhi |","meaning_en":"calling himself very wise, he earns the likeness of a crow;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ ਲੋਕ) ਕਾ ਦੀ ਉਪਮਾ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਸਿਆਣੇ ਅਖਵਾਉਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਤ ਸ੍ਵਾਨ ਜ੍ਯੋ ਮਰੈ ਦੀਨ ਦੁਨਿਯਾ ਪਛੁਤਾਵਹਿ। ੨੦।","roman":"Ant svaan jyo marai deen duniyaa pachhutaavhi | 20 |","meaning_en":"in the end he dies like a dog, and regrets it in faith and in the world.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ ਉਹ ਸੰਸਾਰ ਵਿਚ ਕੁੱਤੇ ਦੀ ਮੌਤੇ ਦੀਨ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਮਰਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਪਛਤਾਵਾ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","gurmukhi":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","roman":"Dohraa","meaning_en":"Dohra.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦੋਹਰਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[21],"number_text":"੨੧।","page":1981,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਤ ਕਾਕ ਕੀ ਮ੍ਰਿਤੁ ਮਰੈ ਮਨ ਭੀਤਰ ਪਛੁਤਾਹਿ।","roman":"Ant kaak kee mritu marai man bheetar pachhutaahi |","meaning_en":"In the end he dies a crow's death and regrets in his heart","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ) ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ ਕਾ ਦੀ ਮੌਤੇ ਮਰ ਕੇ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਪਛਤਾਉਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਖੰਡਾ ਗਹਿਯੋ ਨ ਜਸ ਲਿਯੋ ਕਛੂ ਜਗਤ ਕੇ ਮਾਹਿ। ੨੧।","roman":"Khandaa gahiyo na jas liyo kachhoo jagat ke maahi | 21 |","meaning_en":"that he never grasped the sword nor won any fame in the world.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਸ ਨੇ) ਨਾ ਖੰਡਾ ਫੜਿਆ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਹੀ ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ ਕੁਝ ਜਸ ਲਿਆ ਹੈ ॥੨੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"speaker","name":"ਸਾਹ ਬਾਚ","gurmukhi":"ਸਾਹ ਬਾਚ","roman":"Saah baach","meaning_en":"The merchant said:","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ਾਹ ਨੇ ਕਿਹਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚੌਪਈ","gurmukhi":"ਚੌਪਈ","roman":"Chaupaee","meaning_en":"Chaupai.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਚੌਪਈ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[22],"number_text":"੨੨।","page":1981,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਨ ਸਾਹੁਨਿ ਤੈ ਕਛੁ ਨ ਜਾਨਤ। ਸੋਫਿਨ ਸੌ ਅਮਲਿਨ ਕਹ ਠਾਨਤ।","roman":"Sun saahuni tai kachhu na jaanat | sophin sau amlin kah thaanat |","meaning_en":"\"Listen, merchant's wife, you know nothing; you set the users of intoxicants against the abstainers.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'ਸੋਫਿਨ ਸੌ ਅਮਲਿਨ ਕਹ ਠਾਨਤ': 'you rank users with abstainers'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਹੇ ਸ਼ਾਹਣੀ! ਸੁਣ, ਤੂੰ ਕੁਝ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਣਦੀ ਅਤੇ ਸੋਫ਼ੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਅਮਲ ਦੀ ਗੱਲ ਕਹਿੰਦੀ ਹੈਂ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੋਫ਼ੀ ਰੰਕ ਦਰਬੁ ਉਪਜਾਵੈ। ਅਮਲੀ ਨ੍ਰਿਪਹੂੰ ਧਾਮ ਲੁਟਾਵੈ। ੨੨।","roman":"Sofee rank darbu upjaavai | amlee nriphoon dhaam lutaavai | 22 |","meaning_en":"An abstainer, though a pauper, makes wealth; a user, though a king, squanders his house.\"","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਨਿਰਧਨ ਸੋਫ਼ੀ ਵੀ ਧਨ ਪੈਦਾ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਅਮਲੀ ਰਾਜਾ ਵੀ ਧਨ ਲੁਟਾ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ ॥੨੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"speaker","name":"ਤ੍ਰਿਯੋ ਬਾਚ","gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਯੋ ਬਾਚ","roman":"Triyo baach","meaning_en":"The woman said:","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਕਿਹਾ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਛੰਦ","roman":"Chhand","meaning_en":"Chhand.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਛੰਦ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[23],"number_text":"੨੩।","page":1981,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜੇ ਅਮਲਨ ਕਹ ਖਾਇ ਖਤਾ ਕਬਹੂੰ ਨਹਿ ਖਾਵੈ।","roman":"Je amlan kah khaai khataa kabhoon nahi khaavai |","meaning_en":"Those who take intoxicants are never cheated;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ (ਲੋਕ) ਅਮਲ ਖਾਦੇ ਹਨ, ਉਹ ਕਦੇ ਵੀ ਗ਼ਲਤੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦੇ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਮੂੰਡਿ ਅਵਰਨਹਿ ਜਾਹਿ ਆਪੁ ਕਬਹੂੰ ਨ ਮੁੰਡਾਵੈ।","roman":"Moondi avranhi jaahi aapu kabhoon na mundaavai |","meaning_en":"they go on fleecing others and never get fleeced themselves;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਮੂੰਡਿ: literally 'shave'; to cheat.","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਹੋਰਾ ਨੂੰ ਛਲ ਲੈਂਦੇ ਹਨ, ਪਰ ਆਪ ਛਲੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਦੇ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਚੰਚਲਾਨ ਕੋ ਚਿਤ ਚੋਰ ਛਿਨ ਇਕ ਮਹਿ ਲੇਹੀ।","roman":"Chanchlaan ko chit chor chhin ik mahi lehee |","meaning_en":"they steal the hearts of women in an instant,","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ) ਇਕ ਛਿਣ ਵਿਚ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਦਾ ਚਿਤ ਚੁਰਾ ਲੈਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਭਾਤਿ ਭਾਤਿ ਭਾਮਿਨਨਿ ਭੋਗ ਭਾਵਤ ਮਨ ਦੇਹੀ। ੨੩।","roman":"Bhaati bhaati bhaaminni bhog bhaavat man dehee | 23 |","meaning_en":"and give women in many ways the enjoyment their hearts desire.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ) ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਮਨ ਭਾਉਾਂਦੇ ਰਤੀ-ਦਾਨ ਦਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਅੜਿਲ","gurmukhi":"ਅੜਿਲ","roman":"Aril","meaning_en":"Arril.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੜਿਲ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[24],"number_text":"੨੪।","page":1981,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭਜਹਿ ਬਾਮ ਕੈਫਿਯੈ ਕੇਲ ਜੁਗ ਜਾਮ ਮਚਾਵਹਿ।","roman":"Bhajhi baam kaiphiyai kel jug jaam machaavhi |","meaning_en":"The drinkers lie with women and keep up love-play for two watches;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਮਲ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਭੋਗ ਕਰਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਦੋ ਪਹਿਰ ਤਕ ਕੇਲਕ੍ਰੀੜਾ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰਿਣਾ ਜਿਮਿ ਉਛਲਹਿ ਨਾਰਿ ਨਾਗਰਿਨ ਰਿਝਾਵਹਿ।","roman":"Harinaa jimi uchhalhi naari naagrin rijhaavhi |","meaning_en":"they leap like deer and delight the clever women.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਹਿਰਨਾ ਵਾਗ ਕੁਦ ਕੁਦ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਨਾਰੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਪ੍ਰਸੰਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੌਫੀ ਚੜਤਹਿ ਕਾਂਪਿ ਧਰਨਿ ਊਪਰਿ ਪਰੈ।","roman":"Sauphee charathi kaanpi dharni oopri parai |","meaning_en":"The abstainer, as soon as he mounts, trembles and falls upon the ground;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸੌਫੀ: printed so; read as ਸੋਫੀ."},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਬੀਰਜ ਖਲਤ ਹ੍ਵੈ ਜਾਹਿ ਕਹਾ ਜੜ ਰਤਿ ਕਰੈ। ੨੪।","roman":"Ho beeraj khalat hvai jaahi kahaa jar rati karai | 24 |","meaning_en":"his semen is spilt; how can the fool make love?","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸੋਫ਼ੀ (ਰਤੀ-ਕ੍ਰੀੜਾ) ਆਰੰਭ ਕਰਦਿਆਂ ਹੀ ਕੰਬ ਕੇ ਧਰਤੀ ਉਤੇ ਡਿਗ ਪੈਂਦੇ ਹਨ। ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ ਬੀਰਜ ਖ਼ਾਰਜ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ, (ਉਹ ਵਿਚਾਰੇ ਭਲਾ) ਕੀ ਰਤੀ-ਕ੍ਰੀੜਾ ਕਰਨਗੇ ॥੨੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[25],"number_text":"੨੫।","page":1981,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬੀਰਜ ਭੂਮਿ ਗਿਰ ਪਰੈ ਤਕੇ ਮੁਖ ਬਾਇ ਕੈ।","roman":"Beeraj bhoomi gir parai take mukh baai kai |","meaning_en":"His semen falls on the ground and he stares with mouth agape;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ) ਬੀਰਜ ਧਰਤੀ ਉਤੇ ਡਿਗ ਪੈਂਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੂੰਹ ਅੱਡੀ ਵੇਖਦੇ ਰਹਿ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਰਖਿ ਨਾਰ ਕੀ ਓਰ ਰਹੈ ਸਿਰੁ ਨ੍ਯਾਇ ਕੈ।","roman":"Nirkhi naar kee or rahai siru nyaai kai |","meaning_en":"looking toward the woman, he hangs his head;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਸਤਰੀ ਵਲ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਸਿਰ ਨੀਵਾ ਕਰ ਲੈਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਮਨਾਕ ਹ੍ਵੈ ਹ੍ਰਿਦੈ ਬਚਨ ਹਸਿ ਹਸਿ ਕਹੈ।","roman":"Saramnaak hvai hridai bachan hasi hasi kahai |","meaning_en":"ashamed at heart, he speaks with forced laughter;","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਹਿਰਦੇ ਵਿਚ ਸ਼ਰਮਿੰਦੇ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ ਪਰ ਹੱਸ ਹੱਸ ਕੇ ਗੱਲਾ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਕਾਮ ਕੇਲ ਕੀ ਸਮੈ ਨ ਪਸੁ ਕੌਡੀ ਲਹੈ। ੨੫।","roman":"Ho kaam kel kee samai na pasu kaudee lahai | 25 |","meaning_en":"at the time of love-play the beast is not worth a cowrie.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਕਾਮਕੇਲ ਵੇਲੇ ਉਹ ਮੂਰਖ ਇਕ ਕੌਡੀ ਵੀ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਸਕਦੇ (ਭਾਵ ਆਨੰਦ ਤੋਂ ਵਾਝੇ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ) ॥੨੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[26],"number_text":"੨੬।","page":1981,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤਮਕਿ ਸਾਂਗ ਸੰਗ੍ਰਹਹਿ ਤੁਰੈ ਪਰ ਦਲਹਿ ਨਚਾਵੈ।","roman":"Tamki saang sangrahhi turai par dalhi nachaavai |","meaning_en":"Those who flare up and grasp the spear and make the horse dance amid the enemy host,","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਟੂਕ ਟੂਕ ਹ੍ਵੈ ਗਿਰਹਿ ਤਊ ਸਾਮੁਹਿ ਹਥਿ ਧਾਵੈ।","roman":"Took took hvai girhi taoo saamuhi hathi dhaavai |","meaning_en":"who, though they fall cut to pieces, still charge stubbornly ahead,","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਅਮਲੀ ਲੋਕ) ਖੁਣਸ ਖਾ ਕੇ ਹੱਥ ਵਿਚ ਬਰਛੇ ਪਕੜਦੇ ਹੋਏ ਘੋੜੇ ਨੂੰ (ਵੈਰੀ) ਦਲ ਉਤੇ ਨਚਾਉਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ। ਟੋਟੇ ਟੋਟੇ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਡਿਗਦੇ ਹਨ, ਪਰ (ਫਿਰ ਵੀ) ਸਾਹਮਣੇ ਪਾਸੇ ਵਲ ਵਧਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸਿ ਧਾਰਨ ਲਗ ਜਾਹਿ ਨ ਚਿਤਹਿ ਡੁਲਾਵਹੀ।","roman":"Asi dhaaran lag jaahi na chithi dulaavhee |","meaning_en":"who go against the sword-edges and do not let the heart waver,","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਤਲਵਾਰ ਦੀ ਧਾਰ ਲਗ ਜਾਣ ਤੇ ਵੀ ਮਨ ਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਡੁਲਾਉਾਂਦੇ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੇ ਤੇ ਨਰ ਬਰਤ ਬਰੰਗਨਿ ਸੁਰਪੁਰ ਪਾਵਹੀ। ੨੬।","roman":"He te nar barat barangni surpur paavhee | 26 |","meaning_en":"those men wed heavenly maidens and gain heaven.","page":1981,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹੇ: printed so; the Arril pattern suggests ਹੋ.","meaning_pa":"ਇਹੋ ਜਿਹੇ ਬੰਦੇ ਅਪੱਛਰਾਵਾ ('ਬਰੰਗਨਿ') ਨੂੰ ਵਰ ਕੇ ਸਵਰਗ ਨੂੰ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[27],"number_text":"੨੭।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਸੁਘਰ ਜਿਨਿ ਆਇ ਜਗਤ ਮੈ ਜਸ ਕੌ ਪਾਯੋ।","roman":"Sukrit sughar jini aai jagat mai jas kau paayo |","meaning_en":"The virtuous and skilled man who came into the world and won fame,","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਵਿਅਕਤੀ ਚੰਗੇ ਕੰਮ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਸੁਘੜ ਹਨ ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੇ ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ ਆ ਕੇ ਜਸ ਖਟਿਆ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਬਹੁਰਿ ਖਲਨ ਕਹ ਖੰਡਿ ਖੇਤ ਜੈ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਾਯੋ।","roman":"Bahuri khalan kah khandi khet jai sabad kahaayo |","meaning_en":"then cut down the wicked and had the cry of victory raised on the field,","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ ਦੁਸ਼ਟਾ ਨੂੰ ਖੰਡ ਖੰਡ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਰਣ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ ਜੈ-ਜੈਕਾਰ ਕਰਵਾਉਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਪਾਨ ਸੁਭ ਅੰਗ ਧਨੁਖ ਸਰ ਜਿਨ ਲਯੋ।","roman":"Amal paan subh ang dhanukh sar jin layo |","meaning_en":"who drank intoxicants and bore bow and arrows on his fair limbs,","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਵਿਅਕਤੀ ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ ਜੀਵਨ-ਮੁਕਤ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ ਜੋ ਅਮਲ ਕਰ ਕੇ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਸੋ ਨਰ ਜੀਵਤ ਮੁਕਤਿ ਜਗਤ ਭੀਤਰ ਭਯੋ। ੨੭।","roman":"Ho so nar jeevat mukti jagat bheetar bhayo | 27 |","meaning_en":"that man became liberated while living in the world.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਆਪਣੇ ਸ਼ੁਭ ਸ਼ਰੀਰ ਉਤੇ ਧਨੁਸ਼ ਬਾਣ ਧਾਰਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[28],"number_text":"੨੮।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਬਹੂੰ ਨ ਖਾਏ ਪਾਨ ਅਮਲ ਕਬਹੂੰ ਨਹਿ ਪੀਯੋ।","roman":"Kabhoon na khaae paan amal kabhoon nahi peeyo |","meaning_en":"He who never ate betel nor ever took intoxicants,","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜਿਸ ਵਿਅਕਤੀ ਨੇ ਕਦੇ ਪਾਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਚਬਾਇਆ ਅਤੇ ਕਦੇ ਨਸ਼ਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਕੀਤਾ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਬਹੂੰ ਨ ਖੇਲ ਅਖੇਟਨ ਸੁਖ ਨਿਰਧਨ ਕਹ ਦੀਯੋ।","roman":"Kabhoon na khel akhetan sukh nirdhan kah deeyo |","meaning_en":"never played at the hunt nor gave comfort to the poor,","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਕਦੇ ਸ਼ਿਕਾਰ ਨਹੀਂ ਖੇਡਿਆ (ਅਤੇ ਦਾਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ) ਨਿਰਧਨਾ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਖ ਨਹੀਂ ਦਿੱਤਾ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਬਹੂੰ ਨ ਸੌਂਧਾ ਲਾਇ ਰਾਗ ਮਨ ਭਾਇਯੋ।","roman":"Kabhoon na saundhaa laai raag man bhaaiyo |","meaning_en":"never put on perfume nor let music please his mind,","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਕਦੇ ਵੀ ਸੁਗੰਧੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਲਗਾਈ ਅਤੇ ਰਾਗ (ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ) ਮਨ ਨੂੰ ਚੰਗਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਲਗਿਆ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਕਰਿਯੋ ਨ ਭਾਮਿਨ ਭੋਗ ਜਗਤ ਕ੍ਯੋ ਆਇਯੋ। ੨੮।","roman":"Ho kariyo na bhaamin bhog jagat kyo aaiyo | 28 |","meaning_en":"never enjoyed a woman: why did he come into the world?","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[29],"number_text":"੨੯।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਦ ਗੰਧ ਸੁਭ ਇਸਤ੍ਰਨ ਜਿਨ ਨਰ ਰਸ ਲੀਏ।","roman":"Naad gandh subh istran jin nar ras lee'e |","meaning_en":"The men who took delight in music, fragrance and fair women,","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਜਿਸ ਨੇ ਮਨ ਭਰ ਕੇ) ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨਾਲ ਭੋਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਕੀਤਾ, (ਦਸੋ ਭਲਾ ਉਹ) ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ ਕਿਉਾਂ ਆਇਆ ਹੈ ॥੨੮॥ ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਪੁਰਸ਼ਾ ਨੇ ਰਾਗ, ਉਤਮ ਸੁਗੰਧੀ ਅਤੇ ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਰਸ ਲਿਆ ਹੈ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਲ ਪਾਨ ਆਖੇਟ ਦ੍ਰੁਜਨ ਦੁਖਿਤ ਕੀਏ।","roman":"Amal paan aakhet drujan dukhit kee'e |","meaning_en":"in drinking intoxicants and the hunt, who brought grief to the wicked,","page":1983,"flags":[{"code":"0x71","reason":"subjoined letter typed after the vowel/nasal sign; put in Unicode order (same printed shape)"}],"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਮਲ ਪਾਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ, ਸ਼ਿਕਾਰ ਖੇਡਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਦੁਸ਼ਟਾ ਨੂੰ ਦੁਖੀ ਕੀਤਾ ਹੈ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਾਧੁ ਸੇਵਿ ਸੁਭ ਸੰਗ ਭਜਤ ਹਰਿ ਜੂ ਭਏ।","roman":"Saadhu sevi subh sang bhajat hari joo bhae |","meaning_en":"who served the saints in good company and worshipped Hari,","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸਾਧੂ ਦੀ ਸੇਵਾ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ੁਭ ਸੰਗਤ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਜਪਿਆ ਹੈ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਤੇ ਦੈ ਜਸ ਦੁੰਦਭੀ ਜਗਤ ਯਾ ਤੇ ਗਏ। ੨੯।","roman":"Ho te dai jas dundbhee jagat yaa te gae | 29 |","meaning_en":"they went from this world sounding the drum of fame.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਇਸ ਸੰਸਾਰ ਤੋਂ ਜਸ ਦੇ ਨਗਾਰੇ ਵਜਾ ਕੇ ਗਏ ਹਨ ॥੨੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[30],"number_text":"੩੦।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਚਤੁਰਿ ਨਾਰਿ ਬਹੁ ਭਾਤਿ ਰਹੀ ਸਮੁਝਾਇ ਕਰਿ।","roman":"Chaturi naari bahu bhaati rahee samujhaai kari |","meaning_en":"The clever woman kept explaining in many ways;","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ) ਚਤੁਰ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਕਈ ਢੰਗਾ ਨਾਲ (ਪਤੀ ਨੂੰ) ਸਮਝਾ ਹਟੀ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਮੂਰਖ ਨਾਹ ਨ ਸਮੁਝਿਯੋ ਉਠਿਯੋ ਰਿਸਾਇ ਕਰਿ।","roman":"Moorakh naah na samujhiyo uthiyo risaai kari |","meaning_en":"the foolish husband did not understand and rose up in anger.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਰ ਉਹ) ਮੂਰਖ ਪਤੀ ਨਾ ਸਮਝਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਰੋਹ ਵਿਚ ਆ ਕੇ ਉਠ ਖੜੋਤਾ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਗਹਿਕੈ ਤਰੁਨਿ ਤੁਰੰਤ ਤਰਲ ਤਾਜਨ ਮਰਿਯੋ।","roman":"Gahikai taruni turant taral taajan mariyo |","meaning_en":"Seizing the young woman, he at once struck her with a supple whip.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੂੰ ਪਕੜ ਕੇ ਲਚਕਦਾਰ ਚਾਬਕ ('ਤਰਲ ਤਾਜਨ') ਨਾਲ ਮਾਰਿਆ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਤਬ ਤ੍ਰਿਯ ਠਾਢ ਚਰਿਤ ਤਹੀ ਇਹ ਬਿਧਿ ਕਰਿਯੋ। ੩੦।","roman":"Ho tab triy thaadh charit tahee ih bidhi kariyo | 30 |","meaning_en":"Then the woman, standing there, played this trick:","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਤਾ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਖੜੋ ਕੇ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਚਰਿਤ੍ਰ ਕੀਤਾ ॥੩੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[31],"number_text":"੩੧।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਛਿਤ ਪਰ ਖਾਇ ਪਛਾਰ ਪਰੀ ਮੁਰਛਾਇ ਕਰਿ।","roman":"Chhit par khaai pachhaar paree murchhaai kari |","meaning_en":"she fell to the ground with a crash, in a faint.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਭਵਾਟਣੀ ਖਾ ਕੇ ਧਰਤੀ ਉਤੇ ਬੇਹੋਸ਼ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਡਿਗ ਪਈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹਾਇ ਹਾਇ ਕਰਿ ਸਾਹੁ ਲਈ ਉਰ ਲਾਇ ਕਰਿ।","roman":"Haai haai kari saahu laee ur laai kari |","meaning_en":"Crying \"Alas, alas!\" the merchant clasped her to his breast.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ਾਹ ਨੇ 'ਹਾਇ ਹਾਇ' ਕਰ ਕੇ ਛਾਤੀ ਨਾਲ ਲਗਾ ਲਈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਲਾਖ ਲਹੇ ਤੁਮ ਬਚੇ ਕਹੋ ਕ੍ਯਾ ਕੀਜਿਯੈ।","roman":"Laakh lahe tum bache kaho kyaa keejiyai |","meaning_en":"\"It is worth lakhs to me that you are saved; tell me, what should be done?\"","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਕਹਿਣ ਲਗਾ ਮੈਂ ਤਾ) ਲਖ ਕਮਾ ਲਏ, ਜੇ ਤੂੰ ਬਚ ਜਾਏਾਂ, ਦਸ (ਹੁਣ ਮੈਂ) ਕੀ ਕਰਾ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਕਹਿਯੋ ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਸਹਿਤ ਭੋਜਨ ਸਭ ਕਹ ਦੀਜਿਯੈ। ੩੧।","roman":"Ho kahiyo nrip sahit bhojan sabh kah deejiyai | 31 |","meaning_en":"She said, \"Give a feast to all, together with the king.\"","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਉੱਤਰ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਕਿ) ਰਾਜੇ ਸਮੇਤ ਸਭ ਨੂੰ ਭੋਜਨ ਕਰਾਓ ॥੩੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","gurmukhi":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","roman":"Dohraa","meaning_en":"Dohra.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦੋਹਰਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[32],"number_text":"੩੨।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਾਹੁ ਤਬੈ ਭੋਜਨ ਕਰਾ ਨਾਨਾ ਬਿਧਨ ਬਨਾਇ।","roman":"Saahu tabai bhojan karaa naanaa bidhan banaai |","meaning_en":"Then the merchant had food prepared of many kinds","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਤਦ ਸ਼ਾਹ ਨੇ ਕਈ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਰ ਦਾ ਭੋਜਨ ਤਿਆਰ ਕਰਵਾਇਆ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਊਚ ਨੀਚ ਰਾਜਾ ਪ੍ਰਜਾ ਸਭ ਹੀ ਲਏ ਬੁਲਾਇ। ੩੨।","roman":"Ooch neech raajaa prajaa sabh hee lae bulaai | 32 |","meaning_en":"and invited everyone, high and low, king and subjects.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਉੱਚੇ ਨੀਵੇਾਂ, ਰਾਜਾ ਪ੍ਰਜਾ, ਸਭ ਨੂੰ ਬੁਲਾ ਲਿਆ ॥੩੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚੌਪਈ","gurmukhi":"ਚੌਪਈ","roman":"Chaupaee","meaning_en":"Chaupai.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਚੌਪਈ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[33],"number_text":"੩੩।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਾਤਿ ਪਾਤਿ ਲੋਗਨ ਬੈਠਾਯੋ। ਭਾਤਿ ਭਾਤਿ ਭੋਜਨਹਿ ਖਵਾਯੋ।","roman":"Paati paati logan baithaayo | bhaati bhaati bhojanhi khavaayo |","meaning_en":"He seated the people row upon row and fed them food of many kinds.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਲੋਕਾ ਨੂੰ ਪੰਗਤਾ ਵਿਚ ਬਿਠਾਇਆ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਤ ਭਾਤ ਦਾ ਭੋਜਨ ਖਵਾਇਆ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਇਤੈ ਨ੍ਰਿਪਤਿ ਸੌ ਨੇਹ ਲਗਾਇਸਿ। ਬਾਤਨ ਸੌ ਤਾ ਕੌ ਉਰਝਾਇਸਿ। ੩੩।","roman":"Itai nripti sau neh lagaaisi | baatan sau taa kau urjhaaisi | 33 |","meaning_en":"Meanwhile she set her affection on the king and entangled him in talk.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਰਾਜੇ ਨਾਲ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਲਗਾ ਲਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਗੱਲਾ ਨਾਲ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਉਲਝਾ ਲਿਆ (ਅਰਥਾਤ ਆਕਰਸ਼ਿਤ ਕਰ ਲਿਆ) ॥੩੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","gurmukhi":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","roman":"Dohraa","meaning_en":"Dohra.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦੋਹਰਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[34],"number_text":"੩੪।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭੋਜਨ ਤਿਨੈ ਖਵਾਇਯੋ ਭਾਂਗ ਭੋਜ ਮੈ ਪਾਇ।","roman":"Bhojan tinai khavaaiyo bhaang bhoj mai paai |","meaning_en":"She fed them the food, having put bhang into the meal;","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਰਾਜਾ ਕੋ ਪਤਿ ਕੇ ਸਹਿਤ ਛਲ ਸੌ ਗਈ ਸੁਵਾਇ। ੩੪।","roman":"Raajaa ko pati ke sahit chhal sau gaee suvaai | 34 |","meaning_en":"by this trick she put the king, together with her husband, to sleep.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਭੋਜਨ ਵਿਚ ਭੰਗ ਪਾ ਕੇ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ ਖਾਣਾ ਖਵਾ ਦਿੱਤਾ। ਰਾਜੇ ਨੂੰ ਛਲ ਪੂਰਵਕ ਪਤੀ ਨਾਲ ਸੁਆ ਦਿੱਤਾ ॥੩੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[35],"number_text":"੩੫।","page":1983,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭਾਂਗਿ ਖਾਇ ਰਾਜਾ ਜਗਿਯੋ ਸੋਫੀ ਭਯੋ ਅਚੇਤ।","roman":"Bhaangi khaai raajaa jagiyo sophee bhayo achet |","meaning_en":"Having eaten bhang the king awoke; the abstainer became senseless.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਗਿਯੋ: 'awoke'; apparently the king, used to bhang, soon revived while the merchant lay senseless."},{"gurmukhi":"ਮਿਤ੍ਰ ਭਏ ਤਿਹ ਨਾਰਿ ਕੋ ਤਬ ਹੀ ਬਨਿਯੋ ਸੰਕੇਤ। ੩੫।","roman":"Mitr bhae tih naari ko tab hee baniyo sanket | 35 |","meaning_en":"He became that woman's lover, and the tryst was made at once.","page":1983,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਭੰਗ ਖਾ ਕੇ ਰਾਜਾ ਸਚੇਤ (ਸਾਵਧਾਨ) ਹੋ ਗਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਸੋਫ਼ੀ (ਸ਼ਾਹ) ਸੌਂ ਗਿਆ। (ਰਾਜਾ) ਉਸ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਦਾ ਮਿਤਰ ਬਣ ਗਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਤਦ ਹੀ (ਸੰਯੋਗ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਕਰਨ ਦਾ) ਸੰਕੇਤ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ ॥੩੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚੌਪਈ","gurmukhi":"ਚੌਪਈ","roman":"Chaupaee","meaning_en":"Chaupai.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਚੌਪਈ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[36],"number_text":"੩੬।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਲੋਗ ਜਿਵਾਇ ਬਚਨ ਇਮਿ ਭਾਖਾ। ਸਿਗਰੋ ਦਿਵਸ ਰਾਇ ਹਮ ਰਾਖਾ।","roman":"Log jivaai bachan imi bhaakhaa | sigro divas raai ham raakhaa |","meaning_en":"Having fed the people she said, \"We have kept the king for the whole day;","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਲੋਕਾ ਨੂੰ ਭੋਜਨ ਕਰਾ ਕੇ (ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ) ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਕਿਹਾ ਕਿ ਮੈਂ ਸਾਰਾ ਦਿਨ ਰਾਜੇ ਨੂੰ (ਆਪਣੇ ਕੋਲ) ਰਖਾਗੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਾਝ ਪਰੇ ਰਾਜਾ ਘਰ ਐਹੈ। ਤੁਮਹੂੰ ਤਬੈ ਬੁਲਾਇ ਪਠੈਹੈ। ੩੬।","roman":"Saajh pare raajaa ghar aihai | tumhoon tabai bulaai pathaihai | 36 |","meaning_en":"when evening falls the king will come home, and then he will send for you too.\"","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ਾਮ ਪੈਣ ਤੇ ਰਾਜਾ ਘਰ ਆਵੇਗਾ। ਤਦ ਹੀ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ (ਭਾਵ ਮੰਤ੍ਰੀਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਸਾਊਆਂ ਨੂੰ) ਬੁਲਾ ਲਏਗਾ ॥੩੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Bhujang chhand","meaning_en":"Bhujang metre.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਛੰਦ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[37],"number_text":"੩੭।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਿਲਿਯੋ ਜਾਨ ਪ੍ਯਾਰਾ ਲਗੇ ਨੈਨ ਐਸੇ। ਮਨੋ ਫਾਧਿ ਫਾਧੈ ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਰਾਟ ਜੈਸੇ।","roman":"Miliyo jaan pyaaraa lage nain aise | mano phaadhi phaadhai mrigee raat jaise |","meaning_en":"Her dear beloved was met and their eyes were caught so, as when the lord of deer is taken in a snare.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਰਾਟ': taken as 'the lord of deer' (a stag); uncertain.","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੂੰ) ਪ੍ਰਾਣ ਪਿਆਰਾ ਮਿਲ ਗਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਨੈਣ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਲਗ ਗਏ, ਮਾਨੋ ਕਾਲਾ ਹਿਰਨ ਫੰਧੇ ਵਿਚ ਫਸ ਗਿਆ ਹੋਵੇ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਲਯੋ ਮੋਹਿ ਰਾਜਾ ਮਨੋ ਮੋਲ ਲੀਨੋ। ਤਹੀ ਭਾਵਤੋ ਭਾਮਨੀ ਭੋਗ ਕੀਨੋ। ੩੭।","roman":"Layo mohi raajaa mano mol leeno | tahee bhaavto bhaamnee bhog keeno | 37 |","meaning_en":"She charmed the king as though she had bought him; there the woman enjoyed love as she pleased.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਸ ਨੇ ਰਾਜੇ ਨੂੰ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਮੋਹ ਲਿਆ, ਮਾਨੋ ਮੁੱਲ ਖ਼ਰੀਦ ਲਿਆ ਹੋਵੇ। ਉਸ ਨਾਲ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਮਨ ਇਛਿਤ ਭੋਗ ਕੀਤਾ ॥੩੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[38],"number_text":"੩੮।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਹਿਯੋ ਸਾਹੁ ਡਾਰਿਯੋ ਕਛੂ ਨ ਬਿਚਾਰਿਯੋ। ਮਨੋ ਲਾਤ ਕੇ ਸਾਥ ਸੈਤਾਨ ਮਾਰਿਯੋ।","roman":"Rahiyo saahu daariyo kachhoo na bichaariyo | mano laat ke saath saitaan maariyo |","meaning_en":"The merchant lay where he was thrown and was aware of nothing, as if Satan had struck him with a kick.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ਾਹ ਬੇਹੋਸ਼ ਪਿਆ ਰਿਹਾ ਅਤੇ ਕੁਝ ਵੀ ਸੋਚ ਨਾ ਸਕਿਆ। (ਇੰਜ ਪ੍ਰਤੀਤ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਸੀ) ਮਾਨੋ ਸ਼ੈਤਾਨ ਨੇ ਲੱਤਾ ਨਾਲ ਮਾਰਿਆ ਹੋਵੇ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਸੂਹਾ ਨ ਭਾਖੈ ਉਠੈ ਨ ਉਘਾਵੈ। ਇਤੈ ਨਾਰਿ ਕੌ ਰਾਜ ਬਾਂਕੋ ਬਜਾਵੈ। ੩੮।","roman":"Pasoohaa na bhaakhai uthai na ughaavai | itai naari kau raaj baanko bajaavai | 38 |","meaning_en":"The beast neither speaks nor rises nor stirs; here the king enjoys the woman with vigour.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਉਘਾਵੈ: read as 'stirs / opens his eyes'; uncertain. ਬਜਾਵੈ: literally 'plays, strikes'; a plain term for intercourse.","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ) ਮੂਰਖ ਨਾ ਬੋਲ ਰਿਹਾ ਸੀ, ਨਾ ਉਠਦਾ ਸੀ ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਹੀ ਊਾਂਘਦਾ ਸੀ। ਇਧਰ ਬਾਕਾ ਰਾਜਾ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨਾਲ ਸੰਯੋਗ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ ਸੀ ॥੩੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","gurmukhi":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","roman":"Dohraa","meaning_en":"Dohra.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦੋਹਰਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[39],"number_text":"੩੯।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਾਹੁ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਕੈ ਤਰੇ ਬਾਧਿ ਡਾਰਿ ਕਰ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Saahu paalkee kai tare baadhi daari kar deen |","meaning_en":"She tied up the merchant and put him beneath the palanquin,","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ਾਹ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਦੇ ਹੇਠਾ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਬੰਨ੍ਰਹ ਦਿੱਤਾ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਜੁ ਕਛੁ ਧਾਮ ਮਹਿ ਧਨ ਹੁਤੋ ਘਾਲਿ ਤਿਸੀ ਮਹਿ ਲੀਨ। ੩੯।","roman":"Ju kachhu dhaam mahi dhan huto ghaali tisee mahi leen | 39 |","meaning_en":"and whatever wealth was in the house she placed inside it.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਘਰ ਵਿਚ ਜੋ ਕੁਝ ਧਨ ਸੀ, ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਵਿਚ ਪਾ ਲਿਆ ॥੩੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਅੜਿਲ","gurmukhi":"ਅੜਿਲ","roman":"Aril","meaning_en":"Arril.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੜਿਲ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[40],"number_text":"੪੦।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਪੁ ਦੌਰਿ ਤਾਹੀ ਪਰ ਚੜੀ ਬਨਾਇ ਕੈ।","roman":"Aapu dauri taahee par charee banaai kai |","meaning_en":"She herself hurried and mounted it, well settled,","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਆਪ ਦੌੜ ਕੇ ਉਸ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਵਿਚ ਜਾ ਚੜ੍ਰਹੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਰਮੀ ਨ੍ਰਿਪਤਿ ਕੇ ਸਾਥ ਅਧਿਕ ਸੁਖ ਪਾਇ ਕੈ।","roman":"Ramee nripti ke saath adhik sukh paai kai |","meaning_en":"and sported with the king with great pleasure.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਰਾਜੇ ਨਾਲ ਬਹੁਤ ਸੁਖ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਰਮਣ ਕੀਤਾ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਲੈ ਨਾਰੀ ਕਹ ਰਾਇ ਅਪਨੇ ਘਰ ਗਯੋ।","roman":"Lai naaree kah raai apne ghar gayo |","meaning_en":"The king took the woman and went to his own house,","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੂੰ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਰਾਜਾ ਆਪਣੇ ਘਰ ਗਿਆ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਸੂਮ ਸੋਫਿਯਹਿ ਬਾਧਿ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਤਰ ਲਯੋ। ੪੦।","roman":"Ho soom sophiyhi baadhi paalkee tar layo | 40 |","meaning_en":"with the miserly abstainer tied beneath the palanquin.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ੂਮ ਸੋਫ਼ੀ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਹੇਠਾ ਬੰਨ੍ਰਹ ਦਿੱਤਾ ॥੪੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[41],"number_text":"੪੧।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਬ ਪਹੁਚੇ ਦੋਊ ਜਾਇ ਸੁਖੀ ਗ੍ਰਿਹ ਨਾਰਿ ਨਰ।","roman":"Jab pahuche do'oo jaai sukhee grih naari nar |","meaning_en":"When the two, woman and man, had happily reached the house,","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜਦ ਦੋਵੇਾਂ ਮਰਦ ਅਤੇ ਇਸਤਰੀ (ਰਾਜਾ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ਾਹਣੀ) ਸੁਖੀ ਸਾਦੀ ਘਰ ਪਹੁੰਚ ਗਏ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਹਿਯੋ ਕਿ ਦੇਹੁ ਪਠਾਇ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਸਾਹੁ ਘਰ।","roman":"Kahiyo ki dehu pathaai paalkee saahu ghar |","meaning_en":"they said, \"Send the palanquin to the merchant's house.\"","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਤਾ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੇ) ਕਿਹਾ ਕਿ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਨੂੰ ਸ਼ਾਹ ਦੇ ਘਰ ਭੇਜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਬਧੇ ਸਾਹੁ ਤਿਹ ਤਰੇ ਤਹੀ ਆਵਤ ਭਏ।","roman":"Badhe saahu tih tare tahee aavat bhae |","meaning_en":"The merchant, tied beneath it, came back to the very place","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਾਲਕੀ ਦੇ) ਹੇਠਾ ਬੰਨ੍ਰਹਿਆਂ ਹੋਇਆ ਸ਼ਾਹ ਉਥੇ (ਆਪਣੇ ਘਰ) ਆ ਗਿਆ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਜਹ ਰਾਜਾ ਧਨ ਸਹਿਤ ਬਾਲ ਹਰਿ ਲੈ ਗਏ। ੪੧।","roman":"Ho jah raajaa dhan sahit baal hari lai gae | 41 |","meaning_en":"from which the king had carried off the woman together with the wealth.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜਿਥੋਂ ਰਾਜਾ ਧਨ ਸਹਿਤ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੂੰ ਹਰ ਕੇ ਲੈ ਗਿਆ ਸੀ ॥੪੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚੌਪਈ","gurmukhi":"ਚੌਪਈ","roman":"Chaupaee","meaning_en":"Chaupai.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਚੌਪਈ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[42],"number_text":"੪੨।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬੀਤੀ ਰੈਯਨਿ ਭਯੋ ਉਜਿਆਰਾ। ਤਬੈ ਸਾਹੁ ਦੁਹੂੰ ਦ੍ਰਿਗਨ ਉਘਾਰਾ।","roman":"Beetee raiyni bhayo ujiaaraa | tabai saahu duhoon drigan ughaaraa |","meaning_en":"The night passed and it grew light; then the merchant opened both his eyes.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਜਦ) ਰਾਤ ਬੀਤ ਗਈ ਅਤੇ ਸਵੇਰਾ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ, ਤਦ ਸ਼ਾਹ ਨੇ ਦੋਹਾ ਨੇਤਰਾ ਨੂੰ ਉਘਾੜਿਆ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਮੋਹਿ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਤਰ ਕਿਹ ਰਾਖਾ। ਬਚਨ ਲਜਾਇ ਐਸ ਬਿਧਿ ਭਾਖਾ। ੪੨।","roman":"Mohi paalkee tar kih raakhaa | bachan lajaai ais bidhi bhaakhaa | 42 |","meaning_en":"\"Who put me under the palanquin?\" Ashamed, he spoke in this way:","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮੈਨੂੰ ਪਾਲਕੀ ਹੇਠ ਕਿਸ ਬੰਨ੍ਰਹਿਆ ਹੈ? ਸ਼ਰਮਸਾਰ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਕਹਿਣ ਲਗਾ ॥੪੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[43],"number_text":"੪੩।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮੈ ਜੁ ਕੁਬੋਲ ਨਾਰਿ ਕਹ ਕਹੇ। ਤੇ ਬਚ ਬਸਿ ਵਾ ਕੇ ਜਿਯ ਰਹੇ।","roman":"Mai ju kubol naari kah kahe | te bach basi vaa ke jiy rahe |","meaning_en":"\"The ill words I spoke to my wife stayed lodged in her heart.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮੈਂ ਜੋ ਕੁਬੋਲ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੂੰ ਕਹੇ ਸਨ, ਉਹੀ ਉਸ ਦੇ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਖੁਭ ਗਏ ਸਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਲਛਮੀ ਸਕਲ ਨਾਰਿ ਜੁਤ ਹਰੀ। ਮੋਰੀ ਬਿਧਿ ਐਸੀ ਗਤਿ ਕਰੀ। ੪੩।","roman":"Lachhmee sakal naari jut haree | moree bidhi aisee gati karee | 43 |","meaning_en":"All my wealth has been carried off together with my wife; fate has brought me to this state.\"","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮੇਰਾ ਸਾਰਾ ਧਨ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਹਰਿਆ ਗਿਆ ਹੈ। ਵਿਧਾਤਾ ਨੇ ਮੇਰੀ ਅਜਿਹੀ ਸਥਿਤੀ ਬਣਾ ਦਿੱਤੀ ਹੈ ॥੪੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"speaker","name":"ਕਬਿਯੋ ਬਾਚ","gurmukhi":"ਕਬਿਯੋ ਬਾਚ","roman":"Kabiyo baach","meaning_en":"The poet says:","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਕਵੀ ਕਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","gurmukhi":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","roman":"Dohraa","meaning_en":"Dohra.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦੋਹਰਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[44],"number_text":"੪੪।","page":1985,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਫਲਤ ਭਾਗ ਹੀ ਸਰਬਦਾ ਕਰੋ ਕੈਸਿਯੈ ਕੋਇ।","roman":"Phalat bhaag hee sarabdaa karo kaisiyai koi |","meaning_en":"Fortune alone ever bears fruit, whatever anyone may do;","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਭਾਗ: here 'fortune'; the same spelling is used for bhang in this charitra, a play on words.","meaning_pa":"ਸਦਾ ਭਾਗ ਹੀ ਫਲਦੇ ਹਨ, ਭਾਵੇਾਂ ਕੋਈ ਕੁਝ ਕਰ ਲਵੇ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਜੋ ਬਿਧਨਾ ਮਸਤਕ ਲਿਖਾ ਅੰਤ ਤੈਸਿਯੈ ਹੋਇ। ੪੪।","roman":"Jo bidhnaa mastak likhaa ant taisiyai hoi | 44 |","meaning_en":"what the Creator has written on the forehead, so it turns out in the end.","page":1985,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜੋ ਵਿਧਾਤਾ ਨੇ ਮਸਤਕ ਉਥੇ ਲਿਖ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਹੈ, ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ ਉਸੇ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਹੀ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ ॥੪੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਅੜਿਲ","gurmukhi":"ਅੜਿਲ","roman":"Aril","meaning_en":"Arril.","page":1987,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੜਿਲ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[45,1],"number_text":"੪੫। ੧।","page":1987,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਧਿ ਪਾਈ ਜਬ ਸਾਹੁ ਨ੍ਯਾਇ ਮਸਤਕ ਰਹਿਯੋ।","roman":"Sudhi paaee jab saahu nyaai mastak rahiyo |","meaning_en":"When the merchant came to his senses he kept his head bowed;","page":1987,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜਦ ਸ਼ਾਹ ਨੂੰ ਹੋਸ਼ ਪਰਤੀ ਤਾ ਸਿਰ ਨੀਵਾ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਰਹਿ ਗਿਆ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਦੂਜੇ ਮਨੁਖਨ ਪਾਸ ਨ ਭੇਦ ਮੁਖ ਤੈ ਕਹਿਯੋ।","roman":"Dooje manukhan paas na bhed mukh tai kahiyo |","meaning_en":"he did not speak of the secret to any other man.","page":1987,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਹੋਰਾ ਬੰਦਿਆਂ ਕੋਲ ਭੇਦ ਦੀ ਗੱਲ ਨਾ ਕੀਤੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਭੇਦ ਅਭੇਦ ਕੀ ਬਾਤ ਚੀਨਿ ਪਸੁ ਨ ਲਈ।","roman":"Bhed abhed kee baat cheeni pasu na laee |","meaning_en":"The beast did not grasp what was secret and what was not;","page":1987,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਸ ਮੂਰਖ ਨੇ ਭੇਦ ਅਭੇਦ ਦੀ ਗੱਲ ਨਾ ਸਮਝੀ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋ ਲਖਿਯੋ ਦਰਬੁ ਲੈ ਨ੍ਹਾਨ ਤੀਰਥਨ ਕੌ ਗਈ। ੪੫। ੧।","roman":"Ho lakhiyo darbu lai nhaan teerthan kau gaee | 45 | 1 |","meaning_en":"he supposed she had taken the money and gone to bathe at the places of pilgrimage.","page":1987,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਲਖਿਯੋ: 'he understood/supposed'; could also mean 'he gave it out'."}]}],"ending":{"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਇਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚਰਿਤ੍ਰ ਪਖ੍ਯਾਨੇ ਤ੍ਰਿਯਾ ਚਰਿਤ੍ਰੇ ਮੰਤ੍ਰੀ ਭੂਪ ਸੰਬਾਦੇ ਦੋਇ ਸੌ ਪੈਤਾਲੀਸ ਚਰਿਤ੍ਰ ਸਮਾਪਤਮ","roman":"Iti sree charitr pakhyaane triyaa charitre mantree bhoop sanbaade doi sau paitaalees charitr samaaptam","meaning_en":"Thus ends the two hundred and forty-fifth charitra of the Charitropakhyan, of the wiles of women, in the dialogue of the minister and the king; complete.","page":1987,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਤੁ ਸੁਭਮ ਸਤੁ। ੨੪੫। ੪੬੦੯। ਅਫਜੂੰ।","roman":"Satu subham satu | 245 | 4609 | aphjoon |","meaning_en":"True, auspicious, true. 245. 4609. It continues.","page":1987,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'ਸਮਾਪਤਮ ਸਤੁ ਸੁਭਮ ਸਤੁ' runs across the line break: 'is completed; may it be auspicious'. The numbers are the charitra number and running verse count. ਅਫਜੂੰ: Persian 'afzun', 'more / it continues'.","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਸਮਝਿਆ ਕਿ (ਘਰ ਦਾ) ਧਨ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਤੀਰਥਾ ਦਾ ਇਸ਼ਨਾਨ ਕਰਨ ਗਈ ਹੈ ॥੪੫॥ ਇਥੇ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚਰਿਤ੍ਰੋਪਾਖਿਆਨ ਦੇ ਤ੍ਰੀਆ ਚਰਿਤ੍ਰ ਦੇ ਮੰਤ੍ਰੀ ਭੂਪ ਸੰਬਾਦ ਦੇ ੨੪੫ਵੇਾਂ ਚਰਿਤ੍ਰ ਦੀ ਸਮਾਪਤੀ, ਸਭ ਸ਼ੁਭ ਹੈ ॥੨੪੫॥੪੬੦੯॥ ਚਲਦਾ॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 3 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}],"page":1987,"number":[245,4609]}});
